id: CTB-SRC0033-loop
source: SRC-0033
section: §6.0,§6.1,§6.2,§6.3
kind: requirement
scope: ARC
title: The operating loop: discover, assimilate, validate, execute, observe, propose
applied-in: STG-00.A-1
distinct-from: LXM-REQ-000220
text: The operating loop is discover, assimilate, validate, execute, observe and propose. Learning means that measured outcomes produce proposals; proposals enter through the gate like any other contribution; and nothing modifies itself in production.
